<title>USA: Norand names Millennium as remarketer.</title>
<headline>Norand names Millennium as remarketer.</headline>
<dateline>CEDAR RAPIDS, Iowa 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norand Corp said Tuesday it named Millennium Technologies of Lake Forest, Calif. to remarket Norand's entire line of mobile, hand-held computer systems and open wireless local area network products.</p>
<p>Millennium Technologies will sell and support Norand products nationwide.</p>
<p>Norand designs and manufactures mobile computing systems and wireless data communications networks.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
